@startuml
' Supporting document: ../references/examples.md#domain-relationships-who-owns-a-product
' Scope: draft Orders, owned lines, shared catalog identity. Designation: proposed-design, teaching only.
!pragma layout smetana
title Revision: Order owns lines, Product is shared
hide empty members
class Order
class OrderLine
class Product
Order "1" *-- "0..*" OrderLine : owns
OrderLine "0..*" --> "1" Product : references
note bottom of Order
  Draft Orders may be empty.
  Deleting an Order removes its lines.
end note
note bottom of Product
  Product survives Order deletion.
end note
@enduml
